{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>UltraTimerGo 是一款以極簡視覺與彩色進度弧線呈現計時狀態的計時器，適合烹飪、健身、兒童遊戲、學習及工作專注等情境。它原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，能讓用戶即使隔著房間也能一眼看清剩餘時間。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-284.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>清晰計時一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>UltraTimerGo 提供倒數計時與 iPad 指針時鐘，內置 6 個附圖示的快速自訂預設，並以彩色進度回饋顯示剩餘時間。它具備最後一分鐘高亮、語音指令與語音提示、多種鬧鐘聲，以及淺色、深色與系統主題。用戶亦可透過 Apple iCloud 使用即時遙距計時器，同步掌握進度。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-358-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-359-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-360-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1260x2736bb-38-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1179\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：UltraTimerGo</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/ultratimergo/id6751472255?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T11:17:48.873667+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:10:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:24.519695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:24.519695+00:00","content_hash":"e7abdd6c1f20887fa1ad285218af2d7cde6d969bc835d44df88fc3715ce2d9a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}